msgstr "Back"

#. Under the Open in split heading: the Google app or bookmark picked opens in a new pane under the focused one
#: src/shell/open-app.tsx
msgid "Below the focused pane"
msgstr "Below the focused pane"

#. Under the Open in split heading: the Google app or bookmark picked opens in a new pane to the right of the focused one
#: src/shell/open-app.tsx
msgid "Beside the focused pane"
msgstr "Beside the focused pane"

#. Option of the Release channel menu on the About page of Settings: test versions of Meru before they are released
#: src/settings/updates-group.tsx
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta"

#. Description of the Release channel menu on the About page of Settings
#: src/settings/updates-group.tsx
msgid "Beta gets new features sooner, but it may have more bugs."
msgstr "Beta gets new features sooner, but it may have more bugs."

#. Label of the switch in Settings that blocks ads in Meru's pages
#: src/settings/privacy-page.tsx
msgid "Block ads"
msgstr "Block ads"

#. Label of the switch in Settings that blocks trackers, including the pixels that tell a sender an email was opened
#: src/settings/privacy-page.tsx
msgid "Block trackers"
msgstr "Block trackers"

#. Name of a profile's color
#: src/settings/profile-page.tsx
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Blue"

#. Accessible name of the bookmark button on a tab's row, which saves its page as a bookmark; {title} is the tab's title
#: src/shell/tab-strip.tsx
msgid "Bookmark {title}"
msgstr "Bookmark {title}"

#. Short notice at the foot of the window once the selected tab's page is no longer bookmarked; at most two lines of a narrow notice
#: src/shell/toast.tsx
msgid "Bookmark removed"
msgstr "Bookmark removed"

#. Tooltip of the bookmark button on a tab's row in the wide sidebar, which saves its page as a bookmark
#: src/shell/tab-strip.tsx
msgid "Bookmark tab"
msgstr "Bookmark tab"

#. Accessible name and tooltip of the bookmark button in the title bar of a tab's own window, which saves its page as a bookmark
#: src/shell/bookmarks.tsx
msgctxt "button"
msgid "Bookmark tab"
msgstr "Bookmark tab"

#. Menu item, in the Tabs menu and a tab's context menu, that saves the tab's page as a bookmark of its profile
#: src/main/menu-labels.ts
