msgstr "Bookmark Tab"

#. Short notice at the foot of the window once the selected tab's page is bookmarked; {page} is the page's title
#: src/shell/toast.tsx
msgid "Bookmarked {page}"
msgstr "Bookmarked {page}"

#. Heading of the group of the profile's bookmarks in the New tab launcher
#: src/shell/open-app.tsx
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Bookmarks"

#. Name of a notification sound, picked in Settings
#: src/settings/notifications-page.tsx
msgid "Breeze"
msgstr "Breeze"

#. Menu item in the macOS Window menu
#: src/main/application-menu.ts
msgid "Bring All to Front"
msgstr "Bring All to Front"

#. Label of the row on a profile's page in Settings whose Delete… button deletes its browsing data
#: src/settings/profile-page.tsx
msgid "Browsing data"
msgstr "Browsing data"

#. Description of Browsing data on a profile's page in Settings, once its data was deleted
#: src/settings/profile-page.tsx
msgid "Browsing data deleted."
msgstr "Browsing data deleted."

#. Title of the last group of the Shortcuts page in Settings, listing keys such as zoom and quit that Meru binds and that cannot be changed
