#. Title of the dialog that replaces the license key
#: src/settings/pro-page.tsx
#: src/shared/license-dialog.tsx
msgid "Change license key"
msgstr "Change license key"

#. Accessible name of the Change… button in Settings that opens the system's folder picker for where downloads are saved
